.Dd October 26, 2026
.Dt TMUX-PROSE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm tmux-prose
.Nd flag prose followed by an indented example is not a DocBook definition
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Pp
.Fl T
sets the client's key table; the next key will be looked up using
.Ar key-table .
For example:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
bind-key -Ttable2 c list-keys
bind-key -Troot a switch-client -Ttable2
.Ed
